She went to get some more paper.

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.680
I hope you guys haven't been messing with anything in here.

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:22.060
O-O-Of course not!

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:24.730
We didn't do anything, so hurry up and get out of here.

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:25.650
That's right.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.570
Without turning around, if you would.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:38.450
I won't let you guys off easy if you do something weird, okay?

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.800
Bear!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.840
Pass!

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:52.720
Can you put them...

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:55.720
...back where they belong?!

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:58.270
You bastard!

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.980
You were the one who took them out...

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.900
...so you put them back!

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:11.900
You're good.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:15.280
It's only to be expected of an ace striker.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.870
You're not bad at this yourself, are you?

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.330
There you go!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:22.960
Futaba, you idiot!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:26.500
Why did you leave them there by themselves when you left?!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.880
Is that bad?

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:30.670
You should understand that much by now!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.220
See?

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:36.390
I can hear them having fun in there.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:39.220
According to my profiling...

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.560
...these are Futaba's panties.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.190
Geez.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:44.640
Childish as always, isn't she?

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:48.320
That's way too high...

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:49.480
Hit it with your head!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.230
Satou!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:51.690
Here goes!

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.610
Bear!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.460
F-Futaba, this isn't what you think!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.960
I didn't intend to do anything with your kindergarten panties.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:10.090
I would never actually wear them like this on purpose!

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.260
Shut up!

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:17.510
This is the worst!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.640
Morning, Satou!

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:24.770
Good morning!

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:30.230
Looks like you decided to show your face, pervert!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.280
I'm not a pervert!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.360
What happened yesterday was just an accident!

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:38.700
Listen to me. I'm not a pervert or anything—

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.700
Don't touch me!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.080
You pervert!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.330
Wait!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.330
Please wait, Eldest Daughter!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.210
Wait...

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:51.800
Futaba.

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.010
You'll believe me, right?

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:56.380
I'm actually a very integrable person!

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.590
Yes. That's right!

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:00.350
Futaba.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.850
I brought you a present!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.850
Keep this a secret from Micchan, okay?

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.650
You don't believe me at all!

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:12.150
Shin!

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.900
He looked like he was having so much fun wearing Micchan's panties on his head.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:20.240
I thought that he'd like to have more.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.620
You don't get it, do you, Futaba?

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:23.120
Huh?

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.740
Chiba-shi!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:28.250
It'll embarrass him if you hand them over directly like that.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.750
He's quite the reserved type, after all.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.500
Oh! I see.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:40.010
How on earth am I going to clear this up?

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:43.510
I better get ready for class.

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:47.680
Bear!

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.230
What the hell?!

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.850
Is this Futaba's doing?

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.520
What's with that?

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.320
Panties?

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.480
No!

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:56.820
These aren't mine!

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:57.490
Come now.

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:58.780
Return to your seats.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.990
Class is about to start.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.490
That's it!

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.750
Be sure not to forget what we just went over.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.620
Futaba!

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.540
She's not here?!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.630
Futaba?!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:13.710
Where did you go?!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.340
Futaba?!

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:16.760
Futaba?!

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:18.210
Futaba?!

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.600
That damned Futaba...

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.180
Did she go outside?

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:29.850
Just how many does she have with her?!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.690
Shin.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:37.780
Ta-dah!

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.650
Don't use them for a magic trick!

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.660
You can have all of them!

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:43.410
I don't need them!

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:44.160
Get away from me!

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.910
Chiba.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:50.660
All of this trouble traces back to you.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:51.750
Just explain this...

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:52.750
...to Futaba and Eldest Sister for me!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:58.090
Rather than those love letters that you've been receiving, you're being flooded by panties.

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.630
Aren't you happy?

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.760
Do you have a problem with me or something?

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.970
Why don't you give up your high-and-mighty path of righteousness...

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.720
...and merge onto the path of perverts already?

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.480
I don't want to.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.230
Shin said that he didn't want any panties.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.770
You still don't get it.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:19.320
Futaba, when it comes to panties...

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:23.150
what's really important is what's <i>inside</i> them, rather than the panties themselves.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:25.160
Oh! I see.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.790
Damn that bastard Chiba!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:31.750
Shin!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.870
Wh-What is it?

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:35.580
I already told you I don't want any—

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.170
Ta-dah!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:41.920
What kind of messed up fashion is that?

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.550
Chiba-shi told me that it'd be better if I wore them.

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:46.550
That bastard.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:47.970
I'll give you these, too.

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.260
I already said I didn't want them!

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:57.480
After all the trouble of stealing these from Micchan for you...

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:57.940
Hey!

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:00.320
Don't cry!

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:03.530
More importantly...

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:04.780
Hurry up and take those off!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:07.120
Are you really not embarrassed?

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:09.280
You want them?

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.290
Geez!

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.080
Fine! I want them!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:13.540
I want them, so please!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.790
Is that Satou?

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.170
When I actually think about it...

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:21.710
it really is unlikely that he'd wear my panties on his head...

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.130
...so shamelessly on purpose.

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:27.090
Maybe Chiba forced him to do it or something.

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:28.140
Whatever.

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.930
I should at least hear him out.

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:22.010
As the sun sets on the schoolyard

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:27.300
I waved my hand, and head back home

00:22:27.550 --> 00:22:32.520
Tonight, when I go to bed

00:22:32.630 --> 00:22:37.760
It'd be great if I can see you again

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:43.310
Let's go to sleep

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:47.260
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:49.450 --> 00:22:54.350
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:59.300
You can even fly into the sky

00:23:00.010 --> 00:23:13.850
My heart aches when I hold your hand, even in my dream

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:19.260
Just like my dream-colored love

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:28.680
As the homeroom teacher for Class 6-3,

00:23:28.680 --> 00:23:30.850
I think I've had enough of modeling for the class.

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:32.150
That's quite troublesome.

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:34.350
I wanted you to model for me, as well.

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:36.200
Well, just once would be fine, I suppose.

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:37.240
Yes.

00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:39.590
Please look at me.
